> help
commands, all run in this tab:
  buy|sell SYMBOL QUANTITY [PRICE] [stop=PRICE] [tif=gtc|ioc|fok] [post-only] [owner=N] [stp=MODE]
                     an order, LIMIT with a price and MARKET without, a stop with stop=; prints its ID
  cancel SYMBOL ID
  replace SYMBOL ID PRICE QUANTITY [post-only] [owner=N] [stp=MODE]
  book SYMBOL        the book, as replay --book prints it
  status             each shard's instruments, and how many records its log holds
  send FILE [--symbol SYMBOL]
                     order_book_cli send: a sample's commands to the running engine
  replay FILE... [--trades] [--events] [--book] [--symbol SYMBOL] [--no-statistics]
                     order_book_cli replay: a sample on fresh books, not the running engine
  verify [--validate final|per-command]
                     order_book_cli verify: what a start would recover from the log; not while it runs
  ls [DIRECTORY]     the sample files, in valid/ and malformed/
  cat FILE           a sample file
  start              start the engine, recovering what its log holds
  stop               stop it cleanly; a second stop forces it
  crash              kill it without warning; it stays down until start
  reset              wipe its log and start again from the seed
  clear | help       clear the screen, or print this
MODE is cancel-resting, cancel-incoming, or cancel-both.
